SUMMARY:Flower Porch: Intro to Centerpiece Design: Spring Edition
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T130000
UID:260408vBojAYCv9kyzpIBCTRaXHA
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Flower Porch for one of our signature design course
 s: Intro to Centerpiece Design. Learn to create vibrant centerpiece arrang
 ements featuring the seasons best flowers\, fruits\, and textures. We’ll
  design our arrangements with beloved spring blooms from Front Porch Farm 
 like peonies\, poppies\, ranunculus\, columbine\, snapdragons\, sweet peas
 \, anemones\, and more.  \n\nWe celebrate process over product and welcome
  all skill levels for an immersive learning experience. \n\nThis workshop 
 includes: \n\nLight refreshments upon arrival\n\nGuided farm tour and harv
 esting demonstration\n\nAll floral design materials to make 1 centerpiece 
 arrangement including a locally made ceramic vessel from Olivet Ceramics \
 n\nPlease arrive promptly at the the start time as we will use the full du
 ration of the class. We recommend always wearing comfortable clothing and 
 footwear for walking around the farm in all terrain including dirt and mud
 . This ticket covers the cost for 1 guest. \n\nRefund & Cancellations: Due
  to limited seating\, cancellations must be made at least 48 hours before 
 your class. Cancellations made before this window receive a credit toward 
 a future class of equal value. No refunds are available.
LOCATION:Flower Porch
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/event/flower-porch-intro-to-centerpiece-des
 ign-spring-edition/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
