 g periods of standing and walking on uneven and hard floors. Theme: Learn 
 the how-to&'s of garden planting Availability: Limited - 15 kids tickets a
 vailable\, 15 adult tickets available Club Members: Discount applies at ch
 eckout Dress Code: Casual\, closed-toe shoes Dietary Restrictions: We glad
 ly accommodate food allergies with advance notice so our guests can dine c
 omfortably and safely. We are unable to accommodate personal dietary prefe
 rences. Age Requirement: Family friendly class Pets: Not permitted at this
  event
