 0:30AM-12:30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFree!\n\n\n\nLearn the basics
  of gouache paint from a materials perspective. We will cover topics such
  as the difference between watercolor and gouache\, traditional vs. acryl
 ic gouache\, artist grade vs. student grade paint\, and more.\n\nAn atten
 dee can expect to take home information about gouache paint\, and a small
  sample painting illustrating different kinds of gouache materials and te
 chniques.\n\nAnna M. Simson holds a BA and MFA in art practice\, and has 
 taught materials workshops\, painting and drawing classes at local colleg
 es\, and makes art in her garage studio.
