X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sonoma.com": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/dry-creek-valley-clean-up-day/", "North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.drycreekvineyard.com/events/page/2/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.exploretock.com/drycreekvineyard/event/595891/dry-creek-valley-clean-up-day"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sonoma.com": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/dry-creek-valley-clean-up-day/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sonoma_com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Sonoma.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T073000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T120000
DTSTAMP:20260411T135655
CREATED:20260319T152738
LAST-MODIFIED:20260319T152738
UID:59572-1775979000-1775995200@https://www.sonoma.com
SUMMARY:Dry Creek Valley Clean Up Day
DESCRIPTION:Each April\, Dry Creek Vineyard brings the community together to care for the place they call home for Dry Creek Valley Clean Up Day. What began decades ago as a service project led by Kim Stare Wallace’s sister has grown into a cherished Earth Day tradition in Dry Creek Valley.  Volunteers gather at the winery for coffee and a brief orientation before heading out alongside partners from Russian Riverkeeper and the Dry Creek Valley Association to help clean local roadsides and waterways. It’s simple\, meaningful work made even better by good company and a shared love for the valley.  After the cleanup\, participants return to the winery to relax and reconnect over light brunch bites and a glass of wine. No experience is necessary\, just comfortable shoes\, a willingness to lend a hand and a love for the community.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/dry-creek-valley-clean-up-day/
LOCATION:3770 Lambert Bridge Road, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.9244491;38.6529364
CATEGORIES:Dining,Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Outdoors,Sonoma County,Wine
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/03/19152605/DCV-Clean-Up-Day-3_8779-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
