X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/ariana-stein-big-pot-demo/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Ariana Stein: BIG Pot Demo
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T180000
UID:260410jEtk5TT4w0SfNMajCGOzYg
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nSunday\, April 12\, 2026 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM Lunc
 h from 1:00 – 2:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 209\, Members Studio\n\nExperi
 ence Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nEvent Categories: Ceramics\, Events\, Workshop
 s\n\nAge(s)\n\n17+\n\n**This event is free to attend. RSVP**\n\nLearn larg
 e pot techniques from ceramicist Ariana Stein. Sunday demo features Northe
 rn Thai coiling & throwing methods. Drop in 10am-6pm.\n\nAbout the Class\n
 \nOn Sunday\, April 12th\, Ariana Stein will demonstrate her technique for
  making a large pot. Ari learned how to make big pots from her mentor\, Ka
 te Waltman\, using a style that originates from Northern Thailand. She use
 s a combination of coiling\, throwing\, and heating the clay\, a method th
 at is ergonomic and friendly to female bodies. Viewers interested in learn
 ing this technique are encouraged to attend the very beginning of the demo
 \, where Ari will walk the audience through the steps in planning and maki
 ng a big pot. Ariana will be throwing from 10am – 6pm. Participants are 
 welcome to drop in anytime during the course of the all day demonstration.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/ariana-stein-big-pot-demo/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
