DESCRIPTION:Tap into your creative flow at Mercy’s Puff N’ Paint—whe
 re cannabis culture\, art\, and community come together in an elevated\, l
 aid-back experience inside The Lounge at Mercy.\n\nPuff\, and paint in a r
 elaxed\, inspiring atmosphere designed to spark creativity and connection.
  Whether you’re focused on your canvas or vibing with the people around 
 you\, this paint session is all about expression\, conversation\, and good
  energy. \n\nPresented by Emerald Sky and Papa’s Herb\, this experience
  is your invitation to slow down\, light up\, and turn elevated moments in
 to art—Mercy style.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Sunday\, April 12\, 2026\n\n
 Time: 12:00 pm - 4:00 pm\n\nWhat’s Included\n\nAll painting supplies\n\n
 Chill\, guided creative session — zero pressure\, all fun and you get to
  take home your masterpiece\n\nAn atmosphere buzzing with smooth evening b
 eats\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark your creativity\n\nTicket Tier
 s\n\nGeneral Admission - $35: Paint Supplies Only\n\nVIP Tier 1 - $50: Inc
 ludes a 🌱$25 Goodie Bag \n\nVIP Tier 2 - $75: Includes a 🌱$50 Goodi
 e Bag \n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://www.themercylounge.com
