DESCRIPTION:Hanna Center and Hanna Academy invite the community to a memor
 able evening celebrating the individuals who have a lasting impact on the 
 lives of others. With over 75 years of dedication to care\, connection\, a
 nd transformation\, this event will raise essential funds to support and e
 xpand the programs that empower youth\, families\, and individuals to thri
 ve in Sonoma Valley.\n\nThe evening will feature a cocktail hour\, a gourm
 et dinner by Park Avenue Catering\, a live auction\, and dancing with Prid
 e & Joy SF. While sponsorships are available for those looking to deepen t
 heir support\, all guests are invited to join in the celebration and help 
 foster a healthier\, more connected community for the future.
