UID:260407T--b5xZXl0eJ9p1Sig4prw
DESCRIPTION:Now in our 13th year\, the Festival will include a day of loca
 l art for sale with over 30 participating artists\, music\, art workshops 
 for children\, a raffle\, food\, and good wine. Due to changes made by th
 e City of Healdsburg\, we will be holding the Festival from the Center and
  Plaza Street to the intersection of Center and North Street.  HCA is ded
 icated to celebrating art in the community with our annual cornerstone eve
 nt in downtown Healdsburg.\n\nPlease\, mark your calendars and plan to joi
 n in the fun!\n\nSeptember 26\, from 10 AM until 6 PM\n\n**Artists who wou
 ld like to participate with a booth and art** **for sale\, please see the
  guidelines.**
LOCATION:Healdsburg Center for the Arts
