SUMMARY:Markham Vineyards Private Tasting: The Cabernet Connoisseur’s Ex
 perience
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T110000
UID:250926O26k96AYCEKb6nOgVuNn4g
DESCRIPTION:**WHAT:** Markham Vineyards Private Tasting: The Cabernet Conn
 oisseur’s Experience\n\n**DATE:**            Begins October 1\
 , 2025\, Offered Daily\n\n**TIME:** 11am-1pm and 2-4pm\n\n**WHERE:**   
     Markham Vineyards\n\n                       
  2812 St Helena Hwy North\, St Helena\, CA 94574\n\n           
              707-963-5292\n\n                
         https://markhamvineyards.com/ \n\n**LINK:**        
      https://markhamvineyards.com/visit/winery-experiences/\n\n**DETAI
 LS:**\n\nDiscover the pinnacle of Markham Cabernet Sauvignon. This private
 ly guided tasting features rare library vintages\, limited single-vineyard
  wines\, and an exclusive barrel tasting of The Philanthropist\, our flags
 hip 100% Cabernet Sauvignon\, expertly paired with local cheeses\, charcut
 erie\, and chocolates. A collector’s journey through the past\, present\
 , and future of Napa Valley Cabernet.\n\nEach booking is private and guide
 d by a dedicated Ambassador. Guests will also step inside the Markham wine
 ry to sample a yet-to-be-released vintage of The Philanthropist Cabernet S
 auvignon from a French Oak barrel.\n\n·         **Offered Daily:*
 * 11:00 am – 1:00 pm and 2:00 – 4:00 pm\n\n·         **Experi
 ence length:** 2 hours\n\n·         **Wines:** Selections of libr
 ary\, limited single-vineyard\, and a barrel tasting of yet-to-be-released
  Cabernet Sauvignon\n\n·         **Cost:** $150 per Person\n\n·
          **Exclusive Member Price:** $95 per Member\n\n**ADMISSION
 :** Members $95 | Non-members $150
LOCATION:Markham Vineyards
URL:https://markhamvineyards.com/visit/winery-experiences/ 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brandlin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00", "Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/the-brandlin-estate-wine-food-tasting-experience/18318441/2026-04-14T11"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brandlin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Brandlin Estate Wine & Food Tasting Experience
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260414T160000
UID:260312iUk8s3QEDEeX38tYTh8HrA
DESCRIPTION:Born on the rugged slopes of Mount Veeder\, Brandlin Estate pr
 oduces wines of structure\, intensity\, and place. The Brandlin Experience
  offers an in-depth exploration of this historic vineyard site through a c
 urated tasting of five estate-grown wines—including Zinfandel from centu
 ry-old vines and the estate’s signature Cabernet Sauvignon. This seated\
 , guided experience invites guests to delve into the mountain terroir thro
 ugh the lens of small-lot winemaking. Each wine reflects the elevation\, e
 xposure\, and rocky soils that define the Brandlin Estate. For an added di
 mension\, guests may opt to include seasonal bites\, thoughtfully paired t
 o complement the structure and complexity of the wines. This experience is
  hosted at the picturesque Boathouse.
LOCATION:Brandlin Estate 
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brand
 lin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
