SUMMARY:On the Trail of the Logos
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n**On the Trail of the Lo
 gos**\n\nThe Logos is an intriguing and wide-ranging concept for students 
 of life and mysticism. We will consider its meaning\, implications\, and a
 pplication through the ages and by the Rosicrucians. For example\, does th
 e Logos cause the world to be an icon and script of the Divine? If so\, ca
 n they be read through increased sensitivity and wisdom for the well-being
  of all? Join Hugh McCague as we continue to review Rosicrucian laws and p
 rinciples for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**
 Please RSVP to access log-in link. Click Attend Online button below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31405
 7078/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260331T171236Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260331T171236Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
