DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260415T183000
UID:260409bqf01n_XmUKQz-7WJevKGA
DESCRIPTION:CIA at Copia is proud to be the home of the newest wine tastin
 g experience and podcast series\, *Quench at Copia\,* with Master Sommel
 ier Andrea Immer Robinson. You will get to be part of a live studio audien
 ce through a guided tasting with special guests from the culinary and wine
  industries who will join along the way. Each event invites you to learn 
 and connect through exceptional wines\, thoughtful pairings\, and lively c
 onversation. \n\nCabernet lovers\, this one is for you. We welcome you 
 to be part of CIA at Copia’s newest wine tasting experience with Maste
 r Sommelier Andrea Immer Robinson in her *Quench at Copia* series\, wi
 th special guest and Master Sommelier Carlton McCoy. In this experience\,
  you’ll be focusing on one of the “GOAT”-ed Grapes: Cabernet
 . Through a guided tasting and expert insight\, you’ll uncover what g
 ives Cabernet its power\, elegance\, and unmistakable character.\n\n**This
  experience will also be paired with a “Taste of The Grove” – a samp
 le of a dish from The Grove Restaurant curated by our former CIA stu
 dent and Michelin-starred chef.**\n\n**What's included:** \n\n**A welcome 
 glass of Chandon 2017 Vintage**\n\n**Barboursville Octagon\, Virginia**\n\
 n**Chateau Lascombes\, Margaux**\n\n**Mazzei Phillip Super Tuscan Cabernet
 **\n\n**Sena\, Chile**\n\n**Heitz Cabernet Sauvignon C91**
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
URL:https://www.ciaatcopia.com/quench-wine-podcast-at-copia/?utm_source=we
 bsite&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=quench-at-copia-city-spark
