DESCRIPTION:Slow down\, connect\, and create together in this calming begi
 nner-friendly activity making abstract art.\n\nIn this special workshop\, 
 we'll explore Neurographic art – a relaxing drawing process that transfo
 rms simple lines and shapes into beautiful\, flowing designs.\n\nAs we dra
 w\, or watercolor paint\, we’ll practice mindfulness techniques that enc
 ourage focus\, calm\, and creativity.\n\nThere’s no “right” or “wr
 ong” in this class\, just gentle guidance\, quiet moments\, and the joy 
 of making art side by side.\n\nBYOB drinks & snacks. Wine welcome\, kitche
 n on site.\n\nAll supplies provided
