X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonomaroses.org/programs"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Photographing Your Roses
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T200000
UID:260330PgHOhKM3yEy7QeS93YGTJw
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Betty Mott\, Master Rosarian. Betty will share si
 mple techniques for capturing the beauty of roses\, printing your images a
 nd framing them\, and how to best style and shoot your blooms. For those w
 anting to enter your rose pictures into the Spring Rose Show\, Betty will 
 offer valuable tips on how to present award-winning rose photography that 
 will catch a judge's eye!\n\nWhat to bring: One or two 8x10 glossy prints.
  You will be given a free photo mat\, backing and protective sleeve for ea
 ch photo. Betty will demonstrate how to mount a photo to best show off you
 r artistry.\n\nAbout Betty Mott: An active member of the Marin Rose Societ
 y and Santa Clarita Rose Society\, Betty is an ARS Horticulture Judge\, Ph
 otography Judge\, Master Rosarian and ARS Bronze Honor Medal recipient. At
  the District level\, Betty has served in a wide variety of positions incl
 uding Secretary\, Program and Speakers Chair\, member of the Bylaws Revisi
 on Committee and her current role as Photography Judges Chair.\n\n"Roses h
 ave always been a part of my life. Growing up in New England learning from
  my Dad's organic gardening practices helped grow my love for nature\, whi
 ch fueled my passion for photography. One of my great joys is photographin
 g roses outside with natural lighting to tell a story that brings you back
  again and again to gaze upon the image with wonder."--Betty Mott
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Art & Garden Center
URL:https://www.sonomaroses.org/programs
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/samba-no-pe"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Samba no Pé - First Class
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T193000
UID:260317JdbKLTKuNkCEK-vhVrcc-Q
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to feel the rhythm and energy of Rio de Janeiro! Sa
 mba no Pé \\(Samba in the Foot\\) is the captivating solo style of samba
  danced in the streets and at Carnival\, known for its rapid\, intricate f
 ootwork and infectious hip movements.\n\nYou will learn\n\nThe Basic Step:
  You will master the signature quick-quick-slow rhythm that defines Samba 
 no Pé.\n\nArm & Hip Styling: You will learn how to add the authentic flai
 r\, movement\, and energy that makes Brazilian samba so captivating.\n\nTe
 chnique & Posture: You will receive tips on proper body alignment to help 
 you dance longer\, faster\, and more safely.\n\nRhythm & Musicality: You w
 ill learn how to connect your movement directly to the irresistible beat o
 f the bateria \\(the samba drum section\\).\n\nThis class is perfect for a
 nyone looking to connect with the vibrant spirit of Brazil\, improve coord
 ination\, and get a fantastic workout—all while learning the foundationa
 l steps of this iconic dance. No partner or prior dance experience is requ
 ired! Just bring your enthusiasm and comfortable shoes!\n\nDate & Time: Th
 ursdays @6:30PM – 7:30PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafae
 l\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allo
 wed.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 • San Rafael
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/samba-no-pe
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
