SUMMARY: Pilot Parallel Pen Demonstration: Beyond the Basics
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Juanita Watkins\nThursday\, April 16th\n4:30PM-5:
 30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree!\n\nJoin local artist and calli
 grapher Juanita Watkins for this valuable demonstration that will introdu
 ce participants to advanced techniques for creating art and lettering wit
 h Pilot Parallel Pens. She will discuss how to create multicolored letter
 ing by touching pens. You will learn how to create shimmering gold ink ef
 fects using Finetec Gold and other Finetec colors\, and how to use a Para
 llel Pen to ink a pointed dip pen to add fine lines and other effects. Ot
 her topics will include the unusual properties of various inks\, how to u
 se other inks than Pilot's\, how to completely dismantle and clean a Para
 llel Pen\, and Cadel Lettering.\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Calligraphy
