X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/introduction-to-raku/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Introduction to Raku Processes\; Pre-req for may Raku Workshops
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260417T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260417T200000
UID:260410iLFXwkcB10CMyx6PoiZwlA
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nFriday\, April 17\, 2026 5:00 PM – 8:00 PM\n\nLo
 cation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\n
 Event Categories: Ceramics\, Workshops\n\nAge(s)\n\n17+\n\nRegistration Co
 st:\n\n$40\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n**
 $40**\n\nIntroduction to Raku Processes\; Pre-req for may Raku Workshops A
 bout the Class This workshop is specifically designed for complete beginne
 rs who want to explore Raku ceramics. It serves as a…\n\nAbout the Class
 \n\nThis workshop is specifically designed for **complete beginners** who 
 want to explore Raku ceramics. It serves as a foundational step for anyone
  intending to register for Ken Carmean’s subsequent Raku Firing course.T
 his introductory class is focused on preparation and theory and **will not
  include an actual firing** of the Raku kiln. The emphasis is on building 
 the knowledge base and technical understanding for a successful firing exp
 erience. In this workshop we will look at the history and philosophy of Ra
 ku. We will explore the materials\, such as glazes and clay\, that will se
 t you up for success. We will also talk about safety and personal protecti
 on to bring while firing the kiln. This workshop will have a hands-on comp
 onent\, where we will create sculptural work to bisque for the upcoming fi
 ring with Ken Carmean.  We will conduct a thorough “dry run” simulati
 on of the entire Raku firing sequence. This demonstration will cover every
  step\, from loading the kiln using tongs and placing the piece into the r
 eduction chamber (e.g.\, metal can with combustibles).
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/introduction-to-raku/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
