DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day and enhance one of Vallejo’s beautiful w
 aterways! Come join us at Blue Rock Springs Creek for a cleanup throughout
  the creek corridor.\n\nPark for free at the Wardlaw Dog Park lot \\(1805 
 Ascott Parkway\\)\, then follow the path behind the dog park and cross the
  bridge. Wear comfortable clothes\, sturdy shoes\, hat\, sunscreen\, and g
 loves. It’s a family-friendly event\, and volunteers of all ages and abi
 lities are welcome \\(if you are under 18\, you must be accompanied by an 
 adult\\). We’ll provide tools\, buckets\, water and refreshments.
