UID:260120IYq9VvdnWEaA0VoSLhoyJQ
DESCRIPTION:There are lots of wonderful California native shrubs and peren
 nials that make perfect additions to existing gardens and are great replac
 ements for better known non-native plants. Master Gardener Linda King will
  discuss some reasons for adding California native plants to your garden a
 nd look at some core native plants that are easy to care for and make grea
 t additions to any existing garden. Registration Encouraged: Go to sonomam
 g.ucanr.edu Upcoming Events to complete your registration. After registeri
 ng\, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about at
 tending the library talk. Learn about home gardening\, pest management\, w
 ater conservation practices\, and more from your Sonoma County UC Master G
 ardeners! Different presentation topic per location.
