DESCRIPTION:Made Local Marketplace is delighted to host a variety of free 
 tasting experiences on our patio in the month of April\, from 12-4pm every
  Saturday.\n\nStarting with 61coconuts Peanut Brittle on 4/4/26\, we'll th
 en try bean-to-bar chocolate with Cacao Regina on 4/11/26\, and Sprouted H
 eart's Granola Bars on 4/18/26!\n\nDrop by Grant Avenue to support your ne
 ighbors - all of these talented makers are from Marin! Stay tuned for more
  deliciousness as we schedule more local artisan food tastings!
