BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.scgsonline.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Top 10 Tips for Using AI Effectively in Genealogy
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T123000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T143000
UID:260408q9HYdvwwK0CwR92rFz5hZw
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Genealogical Society Presents\n\n **Top 10 
 Tips for Using AI Effectively in Genealogy: Unlocking New Possibilities**\
 n\n with Diane Henriks\n\nExplore how to effectively leverage artificial 
 intelligence tools beyond traditional genealogical databases with practica
 l understanding\, real-world examples\, actionable tips\, and best practic
 es to empower you to integrate AI tools into your research workflows confi
 dently and ethically.\n\nDiane Henriks is also known as the *Descendant De
 tective* and founder of *Know Who Wears the Genes in Your Family*. She spe
 cializes in descendancy and brick wall research\, along with  living peop
 le search and unknown parentage. Diane has worked closely with private inv
 estigators to find living people and also assisted in the cases\, both civ
 il and criminal. She is a member of the Association of Professional Geneal
 ogists\, the Southern California Genealogical Society\, and the Utah Genea
 logical Association.\n\nFREE\n\nVia ZOOM\n\n Register at **https://www.sc
 gsonline.org**\n\n Registration closes Friday\, April 17th
URL:https://www.scgsonline.org 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
