DESCRIPTION:**4-Week Flowers Course** \n\nLearn basic techniques\, color m
 ixing\, brush strokes & have fun exploring the beauty of watercolors. \n\n
 This is for beginners & all those who have ever wanted to try the magic of
  watercolor paint.\n\nWe'll practice basic watercolor techniques\, wet-on-
 wet technique\, glazing & layering\, as we delve into the beauty & magic o
 f painting nature.\n\nDiscover a step-by-step process for creating express
 ive watercolor FLOWERS as we explore light and texture to capture your s
 ubject.\n\n**Fee**: $160\, must bring own supplies.\n\nDrop-in rate $50 (i
 f class space allows)
