DESCRIPTION:The Art of Brioche: A Two-Color Cowl\n\nCurious about brioche 
 knitting? In this workshop\, you’ll learn the fundamentals of this beaut
 ifully textured technique while starting a cozy two-color cowl. Brioche cr
 eates a lofty\, reversible fabric that looks complex but becomes rhythmic 
 once you understand the structure.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Le
 arn the basics of brioche knitting\n\n• Practice brioche knit \\(BRK\\) 
 and brioche purl \\(BRP\\)\n\n• Work two-color brioche in the round\n\n
 • Learn to read your brioche stitches and fix simple mistakes\n\nMateria
 ls not included and are available at Gather.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
