X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Christians
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T210000
UID:2603249rKN1afuVUe_LKssVX4beA
DESCRIPTION:Cinnabar Theater presents The Christians by Lucas Hnath\n\nA p
 owerful\, thought-provoking drama about faith\, conviction\, and the cost 
 of standing by your beliefs.\n\nWhen a beloved megachurch pastor delivers 
 a sermon that challenges a core doctrine\, his congregation is thrown into
  turmoil. What follows is an intimate and gripping exploration of belief\,
  doubt\, leadership\, and community—inviting audiences to wrestle with b
 ig questions that linger long after the final moment on stage.\n\n• Warr
 en Theater\, Sonoma State University \\(Ives Hall\\)\, 1801 East Cotati Av
 e\, Rohnert Park\, CA 94928\n\n• April 10–26\, 2026\n\n• Fridays & S
 aturdays at 7:30 PM | Sundays at 2:00 PM\n\n• Special Talkback Post Show
 : Sunday\, April 19\n\nDirected by Nathan Cummings and featuring a stellar
  cast\, this minimalist\, emotionally resonant production is recommended f
 or mature audiences.\n\nTickets: cinnabartheater.org
LOCATION:Sonoma State University
URL:https://cinnabartheater.org/show/thechristians/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/leading-ladies"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Leading Ladies - Play
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260418T213000
UID:26040757y2Uh6RaU6W64oIaNQn1Q
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Amanda Claiborne\n\nSponsored by Dobie Edmunds\, L
 ee Hunt & Joan Meisel\n\nIn this hilarious comedy\, two English Shakespear
 ean actors\, Leo and Jack\, find themselves down on their luck.\n\nBut the
 n\, what luck!  They hear that dear old Florence is about to die and leav
 e her fortune to her two long lost English nephews whom she has never seen
 . For Jack and Leo it is the work of an instant to turn themselves into n
 ephews Max and Steve and grab the cash.  And that’s when the complicati
 ons set in… \n\nRomantic entanglements abound\, as Some Like It Hot mee
 ts Twelfth Night in this screwball comedy filled with bad behavior\, high 
 heels and a world of comedy.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/leading-ladies
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
