SUMMARY:Petaluma Vintage Market
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260419T090000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260419T150000
UID:260404Zw3IykkwGk6Wop-z4CzwJw
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Vintage Market™ is a monthly outdoor marketplace fe
 aturing 85+ sellers with a wide mix of antiques\, vintage fashion\, record
 s\, toys\, art\, furniture\, and collectibles.\n\nFrom mid-century furnitu
 re to comic books\, from retro signs to classic concert tees — there’s
  always something unexpected at Petaluma Vintage™. Local organic food tr
 ucks\, gourmet coffee and crepes.\n\nFree to attend Easy on-site parking. 
