BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/adrian-west-band/18524301/2026-04-19T16"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Adrian West Band
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260419T160000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260419T190000
UID:260408XCnPmpyfvEav5RT0P-QenQ
DESCRIPTION:Come hear the five-piece Adrian West Band perform in the beerg
 arden at Brewsters in Petaluma! Free show\, all ages (tips appreciated). W
 e play from 4 to 7pm.\n\nAdrian West Band is a five-piece acoustic rock en
 semble from Oakland. They play a fun mix of originals\, covers and instrum
 entals plus a bit of jazz. Some have described their sound as “Paul Simo
 n meets Talking Heads”.\n\nAdrian enjoys setting philosophical lyrics to
  joyful music. His topics may veer a tad dark at times but the underlying 
 music is uplifting\, giving the listener a richly layered experience. Whet
 her he's telling a story about a skinny-dipping episode gone awry or grapp
 ling with some major challenge facing humanity\, his lyrics are infused wi
 th equal parts hope\, realism and whimsy.\n\nAdrian West - vocals\, acoust
 ic guitar\, elec. violin & live looping Genevieve Basile - vocals\, percus
 sion Chris Haag - alto sax TBD - upright bass TBD - drums\n\nBand website:
  www.adrianwest.com\n\n\\------\n\nBrewsters Beer Garden is located in the
  historic district of downtown Petaluma. We are an open-air dining restaur
 ant with over 350 seats.\n\nOur cuisine is focused on technique driven dis
 hes influenced by Southern Carolina BBQ and a smattering of locally source
 d and sustainably raised Petaluma producers and ranchers. Think southern B
 BQ meets California produce with a refined touch of explosive flavors.\n\n
 The dining space compliments the food perfectly as guests are treated to o
 utdoor seating in a historic setting\, with the comforts of large heat lam
 ps\, fire pit and live music stage.\n\nWe offer an array of over 30 revolv
 ing local craft beers on draft\, Sonoma and Napa Valley wine\, and a full 
 selection of spirits and cocktails.\n\nBrewsters was built for people that
  want more than just a good meal when they eat\, they want a dining experi
 ence. We are laid back\, kid & dog friendly\, and like to have fun.\n\nMor
 e at www.brewstersbeergarden.com
LOCATION:Brewsters Beer Garden
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/adrian-west-band/185243
 01/2026-04-19T16
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
