DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260419T180000
UID:260408f0FJoGYsXEGEbWzuy2VrPw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an electric night of funk\, soulful blues\, and ro
 ck ’n’ roll featuring The Blender and the powerhouse grooves of Dylan 
 Black Project. Part concert\, part jam\, this is a high-energy music sessi
 on built for collaboration\, spontaneity\, and deep-pocket rhythm. Channel
 ing the raw\, nasty funk of The Midnight Special era\, Dylan Black Project
  brings finger-popping R&B\, rock-solid musicianship\, and undeniable chem
 istry to the stage. Hosted by Terry Sanders\, this is a living\, breathing
  musical experiment\, equal parts showcase and open jam\, as we dial in a 
 format that works best for musicians and audiences alike. Musicians: Sign 
 up to participate HERE: https://forms.gle/6kbvdGYnwi7GDVzZ7 Jam Fee \\(Mus
 icians\\) $5–$10 Jam Fee \\(standard jam-night pricing\\) Tickets: Zone 
 A $29 Zone B $22 Zone C $15 \\(Does not guarantee seats\\) At Door $25 \\(
 Zone C only\\) Doors open 5:30pm.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/769751202874081/
