UID:260410devDV69d90eilUvirM6jLA
DESCRIPTION:Kabbalah & Coffee ☕☕\n\nMidnight. After 210 years of slave
 ry in Egypt\, Pharaoh finally caved after 10 plagues\, and the Jews were a
 ble to leave. Immediately\, they started counting down 49 days\, until the
  moment they were to stand at the foot of Mount Sinai to receive the Torah
 .\n\nWhat does this 49-day journey through the desert represent? Join us a
 s we explore the mystical 7-step self-exploration transformative process t
 hat prepared the Jews to become the Chosen Nation.\n\n3 Tuesday mornings A
 pril 14th\, 21st\, and 28th - 11:30am
LOCATION:Peet's Coffee
URL:https://www.jewishpetaluma.com/templates/articlecco_cdo/aid/6866303/je
 wish/Kabbalah-Coffee.htm
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
