DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T210000
UID:260406eyVPIDNCrkGJILO2e3xM8A
DESCRIPTION:Kellen Johnston from the Santa Rosa Water Agency will showcase
  the creek restoration project at Lower Colgan Creek which aims to enhance
  habitat quality for fish and wildlife\, restore the natural ecosystem ser
 vices provided by the creek\, improve pedestrian access\, and reduce flood
  risk. When completed\, the creek will meander through a planned neighborh
 ood park.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Art and Garden Center
URL:http://chapters.cnps.org/milobaker
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
