DESCRIPTION:Allied event not run by DSA.\n\nPetition link: https://actionne
 twork.org/petitions/protect-our-students-future-safe-stable-schools-now\n\n
 SRTA is fighting against:\n- Cuts to Special Education – Elimination of sec
 ondary co-teaching and elementary SDC Mild/Mod classrooms\, reductions to s
 pecial education staff\n- Cuts to Mental Health and Student Support Service
 s – Elimination of Restorative Specialists\, 75% of school based therapists
 \, School Counselors\, College and Career Counselors\n- Cuts to Elementary 
 Basic Needs – Elimination of ALL elementary counselors\, planned class size
 s of 32 students (1-6 grade)\n- Cuts to Student Opportunity and Safety – An
  increase from 500 to 700 students per admin (40% increase)\, more closures
 /consolidation of schools
