 ing! DJ Saint Rose Disco plans to keep the vibes high all evening with ep
 ic beats while you sip & savor wines from 20+ Dry Creek Valley wineries!\
 n\nMake sure to dress in your best denim on denim! This Twilight Welcome P
 arty is going to be a festive evening you won’t want to miss.\n\nYou’r
 e supporting the legacy of Dry Creek Valley's agriculture\, story and our 
 non-profit organization – celebrating the valley\, its wineries\, farmer
 s\, grape growers and community!\n\nAlthough we’d love for you to join u
 s for all of Passport weekend\, you don’t need to in order to join us Fr
