BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sec.regfox.com/nocturnalcrawl2026cnc"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Nocturnal Biodiversity Crawl City Nature Challenge 2026
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T200000
UID:260409Ijkz5kUj0EyOJil06UOC3A
DESCRIPTION:What is out after dark? Certified California Naturalist
  Erik Hanson of EH Outings takes us on a nighttime bioblitz al
 ong Lower Bald Mountain and Creekside Nature Trails in search of
  nocturnal biodiversity as part of City Nature Challenge weekend.
  Smartphones with the iNaturalist app will be our main tool\, b
 ut those lacking phones are also welcome to participate. If you
  haven’t used iNaturalist\, or haven’t made an observation fo
 r a while\, this is your chance – just make sure to load th
 e iNaturalist app on your phone before you arrive. \n\nMeet behi
 nd the Visitor Center. Tickets are $10 for general admission\, $
 5 for students\, youth (13-17 year olds)\, Sugarloaf members\, Su
 garloaf or RFO volunteers\, and free for children 7-12. **Tickets
  day-of on site are $15 and might not be available**. All chil
 dren under 18 must be accompanied by a parent or legal guardian
 . This outing is not for children under 7 years old. Tickets o
 n site will be $15 and might not be available. Wear appropriate
  footwear for slippery/rocky trails\, bring layers\, at least a 
 quart of water\, a flashlight or headlamp with red light capabil
 ity\, and of course\, a fully charged mobile phone or camera. P
 arking fees apply.\n\nThe 2026 City Nature Challenge runs from Ap
 ril 24 to 27. It’s a bioblitz-style friendly competition where
  "cities" are in a contest against each other to see who can 
 make the most observations of nature\, who can find the most sp
 ecies\, and who can engage the most people.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/nocturnalcrawl2026cnc
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-with-tyler/17624477/2026-04-24T18"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa with Tyler
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T193000
UID:260319udwN7XbiG0aPLwRJ_Qu-LA
DESCRIPTION:Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?\n\nAre you a 
 salsa dancer who has the basics down but is ready to add more? Our Interme
 diate Salsa Class with Tyler is designed to help you transform your dancin
 g moves. In this class\, you’ll go beyond the basics to learn intricate 
 footwork\, enhance your leading and following skills\, and master the body
  movement that will make you shine on the dance floor. This class is for a
 nyone ready to learn the techniques and intermediate steps needed to take 
 their dancing to the next level.\n\nYou’ll learn intermediate dancing te
 chniques that will help you:\n\nExpress yourself with sharper footwork and
  styling.\n\nMaster complex turn patterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen 
 your lead and follow for seamless\, connected dancing.\n\nAdapt to differe
 nt partners and music with ease on the social dance floor.\n\nWhat to Expe
 ct: Instructor Tyler blends a fun\, supportive atmosphere with structured
  lessons\, so you’re always challenged but never overwhelmed. Helping yo
 u progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDe
 tails:\n\nNo partner necessary—rotations ensure everyone dances.\n\nPlea
 se wear non-marking shoes to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes ear
 ly to warm up and get settled.\n\nWhen: Fridays\, 6:30 PM – 7:30 PM\n\n
 Instructor: Tyler Crandall\n\nWhere: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Raf
 ael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/intermediate-salsa-with
 -tyler/17624477/2026-04-24T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/615pm-beginner-salsa-group-lesson/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Beginner Salsa Friday
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T193000
UID:251212mu1pwKwwi0SzJTGNILnQHA
DESCRIPTION:Join our beginner salsa class. No experience or partner is nee
 ded. Just comfortable shoes and desire to have fun!\n\nGreat for first tim
 ers!\n\nNo dance experience required\n\nNon-marking shoes soles\n\nNo part
 ner necessary\n\nWe know it can be challenging to learn something new. As 
 such\, the beginner salsa class is geared for people who are starting out 
 or those that are returning to refresh their skills. Our relaxed environme
 nt is perfect for learning salsa basics\, as we make it fun and enjoyable.
  In this class you will learn basic directional steps\, proper frame for p
 artner-work and simple turn patterns. We organize our curriculum so that t
 he movements are easy to remember. Join us to learn the fundamentals! No e
 xperience is necessary and no partner is required. Drop-in fee is $20.\n\n
 Date & Time: Fridays @ 6:30PM – 7:30PM\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebnerova\n\n
 Address: 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minute
 s before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION: 4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/615pm-beginner-salsa-group-lesson/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
