DESCRIPTION:Practical\, down-to-earth Alicia has had her heart broken and 
 her world shattered\, but her girls\, Yesinia and Carolina\, know what to 
 do! With Alicia's cousin Lulu\, they launch into a madcap plan of magical 
 manipulation with a little Santeria\, a dash of Hoodoo\, and a whole heap 
 of Brujeria! Get 'engrossed' in this dark Latine comedy about friendship\,
  magic\, and finding yourself after your world falls apart.
