DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260424T214500
UID:250801zoYz70ODikSDM1vWbU-xpw
DESCRIPTION:**A Kingdom at Risk\, a Beat That Won’t Quit\, and Love That
  Rules All!**\n\n***“It’s a feel good riot from start to finish.“* 
 — Jay Darcy\, Mancunion Media Group** \n\n**Get ready for a wild\, laugh
 -out-loud adventure with *HEAD OVER HEELS*—the electrifying musical come
 dy from the creative forces behind Hedwig and the Angry Inch\, Avenue Q\, 
 and Spring Awakening! Nominated for *Outstanding New Broadway Musical* in 
 2019 and powered by the chart-topping hits of the legendary all-female roc
 k band The Go-Go’s\, this high-energy show features beloved anthems like
  “We Got the Beat\,” “Our Lips Are Sealed\,” “Vacation\,” “H
 eaven is a Place on Earth\,” and “Mad About You.”**\n\n**Join a spir
 ited royal family on a whirlwind quest to save their kingdom from doom—o
 nly to realize that the key to their future isn’t written in fate\, but 
 in their own hearts. Packed with irresistible music\, over-the-top comedy\
 , and a whole lot of love\, *HEAD OVER HEELS* is a dazzling\, feel-good sp
 ectacle that will have you dancing in your seat!**\n\nThursdays\, Fridays 
 & Saturdays @ 7:30pm\, Saturdays and Sundays at 2:00pm Run Time: Two hours
 \, 15 mins including intermission\n\nThursdays Adult $33Fri/Sat Eve Adult 
 $44.95\; Senior $38.95\; Under 18 $31.95Sat/Sun Matinee Adult $55.95\; Sen
 ior $48.95Value seating $37.95\\*All prices include fees(707) 523-4185**bo
 xoffice@6thstreetplayhouse.com**
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://6thstreetplayhouse.com/shows/2025-26/head-over-heels/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
