 nded for those who work in licensed childcare facilities \\(such as daycar
 e providers and preschool teachers\\) and meets state / EMSA requirements 
 for CPR First Aid training for CA childcare providers. American Heart Asso
 ciation "Heartsaver Pediatric First Aid CPR AED" certifications are issued
