UID:26040836FNwjbqUk2N8FR20FqtnA
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE NOTE: We are adding an early-access sale on Thursday\, 
 April 16\, from 4pm-6pm\, and we might add more dates. This is because of 
 some plants growing up sooner than expected due to the recent warm weather
 . Please visit our website to learn more and to find out which plants will
  be available at the early sale.\n\nOriginal event info follows:\n\nCome g
 et sustainably grown vegetable\, herb\, and flower starts for your spring/
 summer garden. We accept cash\, card\, and CalFresh/EBT. We offer a 50% di
 scount for CalFresh/EBT customers up to $20.\n\nThis sale is open to all f
 rom 10 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n\nWe will have a special shopping hour \\(9-10 a.m.
 \\) for immunocompromised customers\, people with disabilities\, and CalFr
 esh customers paying with their EBT cards.\n\nWe will post more informatio
 n as the date approaches. Stay informed by signing up for our newsletters.
  Click here to sign up for the monthly newsletter. We will have a detailed
  plant list closer to the sale date. You can expect a variety of tomatoes\
 , peppers\, squash\, eggplant\, and more!
LOCATION:Petaluma Bounty Community Farm
URL:https://www.petalumabounty.org/programs/bounty-farm/plant-sale/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
