DESCRIPTION:Invite Friends to join you aboard River Dolphin. Join Dolphin 
 Charters and Myrna Hayes\, river guide for a morning boat trip on the Napa
  river.\n\nDolphin Charters' Barbara Fitzgerald and River Guide Myrna Haye
 s\, will share an "outstanding river adventure"\, featuring National Park 
 Service sailing ships up close along Mare Island docks\, nesting osprey\, 
 natural\, cultural and naval history on the Napa River/ Mare Island Strait
  and restored wetlands to the north. $50 each. For RESERVATIONS Call 510-5
