BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/events/trashion-fashion/#trash-bash"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Trash Bash/Earth Day
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T160000
UID:260411CBCIqREXokqI4MaArOH8oQ
DESCRIPTION:**Trash Bash**\n\n**in Partnership with City of Sonoma’s Ina
 ugural Earth Day**\n\nApril 25 from 11 AM – 4 PM **·** Free and open to
  the public\n\nThe culmination of Trashion Fashion events season is the fr
 ee wrap up party called “Trash Bash” which takes place at the Sonoma
  Community Center. Attendees will have the rare opportunity to see all of 
 the Trashion Runway Show outfits up-close\, as well as meet with and talk 
 to the designers. The Runway Show winners will be announced\, and a final
  exciting bid call for the Trashion Barbies & Bags Auction will take place
 . To complete the efforts of waste management mindfulness\, Trash Bash att
 endees will be able to visit with Sonoma County waste management organizat
 ions\, and shop with local Sonoma County sustainability businesses and upc
 ycling artists.\n\nSustainability Awards and Winners\n\n2026 Trashion outf
 its on display\n\n2026 Trashion Runway Show winners presented\n\nFinal bid
 ding for Barbies & Bags auction & gallery\n\nEarth Day photo contest winne
 rs announced\n\nGreen Business of the Year award presented\n\nDon’t Miss
  these Earth Day events\n\nUpcycling Artist vendors\n\nDemonstrations from
  sustainability organizations and businesses\n\nSustainable food and bever
 age vendors\n\nAdditional guest speakers for Earth Day\n\nSponsor Trashion
  Fashion\n\nNow in its 16th season\, Trashion Fashion Sonoma is Northern C
 alifornia’s beloved month-long celebration where sustainability meets cr
 eativity. This April\, we’re bringing together artists of all ages to tr
 ansform discarded materials into stunning runway designs\, gallery exhibit
 s\, and community experiences.\n\nIconic Runway Show (April 18) with 40+ w
 earable art designs\n\nBarbies & Bags Gallery Show & Silent Auction (April
  2-25)\n\nFree community workshops and programming (January-April)\n\nEduc
 ational initiatives promoting environmental sustainability\n\nJoin us in t
 ransforming trash to treasure while inspiring our community to reimagine w
 aste and embrace sustainable creativity.\n\nContact mc@sonomacommunitycent
 er.org for more information on how to become a sponsor.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/events/trashion-fashion/#trash-bash
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
