BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.awsomeart.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:2026 AWS APPLE BLOSSOM ART SHOW AND SALE
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T180000
UID:260410PMK25vHhV0yumxw5VcrVvg
DESCRIPTION:AWS (Art Workshop of Western Sonoma County) will be celebratin
 g more than 50 years of its Apple Blossom Art Show & Sale at the Sebastopo
 l Center for the Arts\, 282 S High Street\, Sebastopol\, CA the weekend of
  April 24-26.\n\nThe free artists’ reception is on Friday night\, April 
 24\, from 7 to 9 pm\, featuring wine\, appetizers\, and live music perform
 ed by Copley & Radice.\n\nEntrance to the art show on Saturday from 11 am 
 to 6 pm\, and Sunday from 11am to 4:30 pm\, is included in the Apple Bloss
 om Festival admission*.* The art show will feature more than 150 original 
 works of art ranging from rural landscapes to experimental abstracts*.* Vi
 sitors can buy a raffle ticket for a chance to win an original piece of ar
 t donated by last year’s top award winners\, with proceeds benefiting th
 e Sebastopol Center for the Arts’ children’s programs.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.awsomeart.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
