SUMMARY:Culinary Rummage Sale
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T150000
UID:260225Nwkbz3SHm0q-fi6E2AiYYQ
DESCRIPTION:This one-day event is hosted by the Sonoma Chapter of Les Dame
 s d'Escoffier\, and will offer a treasure trove of culinary finds curated 
 from both amateur and professional kitchens. Shoppers can browse an eclect
 ic mix of cookbooks\, cookware\, tabletop items\, wine and beverage glasse
 s\, service ware\, and vintage culinary pieces\, making it a must-visit fo
 r home cooks\, collectors\, and food lovers alike.\n\nJimtown and Then Sum
  will be open and serving breakfast\, lunch\, coffee and other beverages.\
 n\nProceeds from the culinary rummage sale will directly support the Sonom
 a Chapter of Les Dames d’Escoffier International and its mission to insp
 ire\, advance\, and support women leaders in the culinary\, fine beverage\
 , and hospitality industries. Funds raised help fuel the chapter’s work 
 in education\, mentorship\, and philanthropy\, including grants and commun
 ity-based initiatives.
LOCATION:Jimtown and Then Sum
URL:https://www.lesdamessoco.org/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
