DESCRIPTION:Taste of the Neighborhood at Vineyard to Vintner is your chanc
 e to experience the heart of Napa Valley’s legendary Stags Leap District
 . Gather among the vineyards and organic gardens of Regusci Winery\, where
  dozens of critically acclaimed wines are poured and paired with culinary 
 delights from local Yountville restaurants\, Bottega\, Ciccio\, and North 
 Block alongside Hog Island Oysters and delectable sweets from Woodhouse Ch
 ocolates. Enjoy a strolling lunch\, live music\, and an opportunity to mee
 t celebrated winemakers and vintners. This is the perfect afternoon to ele
 vate your wine knowledge and savor world-class cabernets alongside fellow 
 enthusiasts.
