SUMMARY:Mike Z at Adobe Road Winery
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T163000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T190000
UID:260331wkonNuiTp0Ol7Fevk8Mgsw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Saturday acoustic live music set at Adob
 e Road Winery in Downtown Petaluma. Sip on award-winning wines while enjo
 ying talented local musicians in a warm and inviting atmosphere. Choose fr
 om wines by the glass or bottle to discover new favorites. Reserve your sp
 ot on Tock and make it a memorable night of great music\, fine wine\, an
 d good company!\n\nBorn and raised in San Francisco\, Mike Z joined his fi
 rst “working” band in high school. Although he started as a trumpet pl
 ayer \\(which he gave up because he couldn’t talk\, let alone sing\, whi
 le playing\\)\, he switched to bass\, and then guitar. Playing in Bay Area
  bands early in his career\, he had the opportunity to back such acts as T
 he Whispers\, The Pointer Sisters\, and Johnny Taylor.\n\nMike Z has writt
 en original tunes for film and TV libraries\, and performed on numerous st
 udio tracks.\n\nMike Z appears currently in the bands Z and The Benders an
 d the Mike Z Jazz Trio.
LOCATION:Adobe Road Winery
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/live-music-mike-z-april-25-2026/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
