SUMMARY:Adrian West Band
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T200000
UID:260408RSLTrYLFn0qm4Wu40KGSNw
DESCRIPTION:Come hear the five-piece Adrian West Band perform in the beerg
 arden at Waterhawk Lake Club in Rohnert Park! Free show\, all ages (tips a
 ppreciated). We play from 5 to 8pm.\n\nAdrian West Band is a five-piece ac
 oustic rock ensemble from Oakland. They play a fun mix of originals\, cove
 rs and instrumentals plus a bit of jazz. Some have described their sound a
 s “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”.\n\nAdrian enjoys setting philosoph
 ical lyrics to joyful music. His topics may veer a tad dark at times but t
 he underlying music is uplifting\, giving the listener a richly layered ex
 perience. Whether he's telling a story about a skinny-dipping episode gone
  awry or grappling with some major challenge facing humanity\, his lyrics 
 are infused with equal parts hope\, realism and whimsy.\n\nAdrian West - v
 ocals\, acoustic guitar\, elec. violin & live looping Genevieve Basile - v
 ocals\, percussion Chris Haag - alto sax TBD - upright bass TBD - drums\n\
 nBand website: www.adrianwest.com
LOCATION:Waterhawk Lake Club
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/adrian-west-band/185243
 02/2026-04-25T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
