X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Inspire Napa Valley Wine Tasting\, Reception\, Dinner & Auction
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T173000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T173000
UID:260309i5tggUpxHU2-nENmB0A-HA
DESCRIPTION:The seventh annual Inspire Napa Valley will take place from Fr
 iday\, April 24 – Sunday\, April 26 in Napa Valley. Hosted by Kerrin Laz
 \, founder of K. LAZ WINE COLLECTION\, this exceptional event brings toget
 her wine industry leaders and enthusiasts to raise awareness\, spark chang
 e\, and secure national funding for both Alzheimer’s and dementia resear
 ch and local care initiatives.\n\nThe Main Event commences with a walk-aro
 und wine tasting at Louis Martini Winery showcasing over 35 of California
 ’s most iconic wineries\, paired with culinary stations crafted by top S
 an Francisco Bay Area culinary talent\, Componere. Iconic wineries such as
  Bryant Estate\, Dominus\, Grace Family Vineyards\, and Spottswoode Estate
  Vineyard & Winery will be joined by rising star wineries such as Aerika E
 state\, Kinsman Eades\, Morisoli Vineyard\, and MOWE Napa Valley. The even
 ing continues with a seated wine country dinner and conclude with Inspire 
 Napa Valley’s signature live auction and paddle raise.\n\nDon't miss out
  on this inspiring weekend that combines the best of Napa Valley with a co
 mmitment to making a difference!
LOCATION:Louis M Martini Winery
URL:https://www.inspirenapavalley.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://10000degrees.org/event-landing-page-template/", "Press Democrat": "https://10000degrees.org/event-landing-page-template/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://10000degrees.org/event-landing-page-template/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:10\,000 Degrees Annual Gala: One Amazing Community
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T173000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T210000
UID:260224DDm2PQs26UWaYFqnp6w0Ww
DESCRIPTION:10\,000 Degrees hosts its annual fundraising gala ‘ONE Amazi
 ng Community’ on Saturday\, April 25\, 2026\, at the Marin Civic Center 
 Exhibit Hall in San Rafael.\n\nThe ‘ONE Amazing Community’ gala will c
 elebrate and recognize the contributions of many in the community who have
  played a role in helping achieve educational equity and in supporting stu
 dents from low-income backgrounds to fulfill their dreams of becoming coll
 ege graduates. Proceeds from the gala will benefit students and programs a
 cross the eight Bay Area counties that 10\,000 Degrees serves.\n\nGuests a
 ttending the 10\,000 Degrees ‘ONE Amazing Community’ gala will enjoy a
  cocktail reception\, a seated dinner\, and an inspirational program featu
 ring special guests\, followed by a festive after-party.\n\nAbout 10\,000 
 Degrees\n\nBay Area nonprofit 10\,000 Degrees is unlocking student success
  by giving more students equitable opportunities for a quality college edu
 cation and career success. The organization brings a proven model\, data-d
 riven outcomes\, and a seasoned leadership team to create educational oppo
 rtunities for students from low-income backgrounds. 10\,000 Degrees reache
 s over 16\,000 students and families annually\, including 4\,200 college s
 tudents attending universities and institutions across the nation.
LOCATION:Marin Veterans' Memorial Auditorium
URL:https://10000degrees.org/event-landing-page-template/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
