 1.00 each\; most CDs\, audio books on CD and DVDs are also only $1.00\; ot
 her special books or items $2.00 or priced as marked\; children’s\, teen
  and all genre pocketbooks 50 cents or 3 for $1.00.\n\nSunday is our $10.0
 0 bag sale day. Free River Friends tote bag included.\n\nDelicious home-ma
 de cookies\, brownies and other treats also available for purchase.\n\nThe
  River Friends of the Library supports the Forestville\, Guerneville and O
 ccidental branch libraries. Buy local and support your library!
