 \n\nAge(s)\n\n21 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$65\n\nMaterials Fee:\
 n\nIncluded\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n**$65**\n\nA perfect gift for y
 ou and a loved one. Try your hand at the potter’s wheel and enjoy some l
 ocal wine and cheese while you’re at it!\n\nAbout the Class\n\nEver want
 ed to try your hand at the potter’s wheel\, but not quite ready to dive 
