DESCRIPTION:Fridays | After Comedy\n\nAfter comedy\, Barrel Proof is NO JO
 KE .\n\nWhen the laughs end\, The After begins. DJ Dev takes control of th
 e room with late-night energy\, a packed dance floor\, and a crowd that kn
 ows how to do Friday right.\n\nMore people are skipping heavy liquor and m
 essy nights — and honestly\, same. This is the new move: Soju cocktails\
 , elevated mocktails\, and a club vibe that lets you party without wreckin
 g tomorrow.\n\nNo sticky floors. No Jaeger on your shoes. No waking up mis
 sing your phone.\n\nJust great music\, fun drinks\, and a room full of peo
 ple who came to look good\, feel good\, and stay out late.\n\n $5 Eventbr
 ite | $10 at the door  Free with comedy admission  21+\n\nLaugh early. D
 ance late. Welcome to The After .\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.co
 m** for all sorts of good times ahead!
