DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T160000
UID:2604095ZgmXdYSAkyBXDK1G1iGgg
DESCRIPTION:If you're a rose enthusiast\, you won't want to miss our Annua
 l Rose and Rose Arrangement Show. Now in its 59th season\, this fun and ed
 ucational event is your opportunity to show off your green thumb with rose
 s––from blooms and stemmed roses to eye-catching arrangements. There a
 re several categories (from novice to expert) to enter\, and no previous s
 how experience is required...just your love of roses/gardening! We're look
 ing for volunteers to help throughout the day with exhibitor entries\, lun
 ch service\, and set up & breakdown of the event.\n\nEntries accepted: 7:0
 0am to 9:30am\n\nJudging: 10:00am-1:00pm\n\nPublic Viewing of Winners & Ro
 se Sale: 1:00pm-4:00pm\n\nStay and join us for a special Rose Sale from 1
 –4 PM. Our member partners\, Russian River Rose Co. and Alexander Nurser
 ies & Garden Designs\, will be offering a beautiful selection of roses rea
 dy to take home and plant. It’s a wonderful opportunity to explore excep
 tional varieties and add something special to your garden—we hope to see
  you there!
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Art & Garden Center
URL:https://www.sonomaroses.org/spring-rose-show
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
