BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/starting-with-our-experience-building-the-four-ennobling-truths-for-ourselves-dd2m26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/starting-with-our-experience-building-the-four-ennobling-truths/18363197/2026-05-02T10"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/starting-with-our-experience-building-the-four-ennobling-truths-for-ourselves-dd2m26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Starting With Our Experience: Building the Four Ennobling Truths
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T160000
UID:260324E3yWTr2ht0GWKJn5q-oB2w
DESCRIPTION:No one taught the Buddha the Four Noble Truths. They arose fro
 m the insights of his own practice\, from looking deeply into the nature o
 f his experience. In this two-day program\, you’ll follow the same path 
 of discovery. Teachers Phillip Moffitt and Dana DePalma will guide you in 
 starting with the experience of your own life and building this understand
 ing from within. You’ll look directly at what causes your suffering and 
 explore the practical ways of relief available based on the Buddha’s tea
 chings. You’ll discover how the Four Noble Truths become the Four Ennobl
 ing Truths—not concepts to memorize\, but living insights that transform
  how you meet life\, by finding freedom and meaning in the midst of your c
 ircumstances.\n\nEach day will have periods of sitting and walking meditat
 ion along with Dharma talks\, discussion\, and Q&A.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/starting-with-our-expe
 rience-building-the-four-ennobling-truths-for-ourselves-dd2m26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/53rd-annual-bodega-bay-fishermans-festival?aff=cityspark", "Press Democrat": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/53rd-annual-bodega-bay-fishermans-festival?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/53rd-annual-bodega-bay-fishermans-festival?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:53rd Annual Bodega Bay Fisherman's Festival
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T170000
UID:260316ib_58S4_Kke20_Rv8lZhpQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 53rd Annual Bodega Bay Fisherman's Festival.\n
 \nDates: May 2nd & 3rd 2026\n\n10AM-5PM\n\nTheme: FISH TO DISH\n\nWelcome 
 to the Bodega Bay Fisherman's Festival\, a family friendly fundraiser for 
 25 local nonprofits. Since 1973\, this event has celebrated our local fish
 erman and it's when salmon season is kicked off with a blessing of the fle
 et. The Festival is packed with events for people of all ages: over 60 cra
 ft booths\, live music\, good food\, entertainment and more.\n\nThe Fisher
 man's Festival is an all-volunteer event\, and proceeds benefit Bodega Bay
  Area community services.\n\n \n\nThe festival has its origin as a celebra
 tion of the start of the Salmon fishing season and the annual Blessing of 
 the Fleet. Each year's theme is chosen by the Bodega Bay Fisherman's Marke
 ting Association. At the Festival site itself\, you'll see a wooden boat c
 hallenge where participating teams build a vessel and compete in a boat ra
 ce.  Sign up today https://www.bbfishfest.org/wooden-boat-challenge/\\#reg
 ister\n\n \n\nA favorite attraction is the wine booth featuring more than 
 25 Sonoma County wines and a beer booth with several local ales. Plus we h
 ave something for every palate\; barbecued oysters\, local fish & chips\, 
 clam chowder and a variety of non-seafood food trucks. Live music and ente
 rtainers perform on the main stage all day Saturday and Sunday. Artisans a
 nd vendors from all over California and beyond offer a wide selection of a
 rts and crafts.\n\n \n\nThe Fisherman's Festival is a great venue for kids
  with a play area for face painting\, games\, a touch tank tide pool\, jum
 py houses\, pony rides. Leashed Pets are welcome and encouraged to attend.
  Sunday morning will feature the Blessing of the Fishing Fleet when decora
 ted boats parade out of the harbor to receive a blessing from local clergy
 .\n\n \n\nLive Music All day on main stage\n\nSaturday May 2\n\n10am-11:30
 am The Rotten Tomatoes Rock Band\n\nNoon-2pm Dry Creek Station Country Ban
 d\n\n3pm-5pm Tainted Love- Best of the 80's Live\n\nSunday May 3\n\n10:30-
 Noon 40 Fathom's\n\n12:30 PM-2:15pm Petty Rocks - Tom Petty Cover Band\n\n
 3PM-5PM Mustache Harbor\n\nVisit www.bbfishfest.org for more details\n\nPa
 rking Map
LOCATION:Westside Regional Park
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/53rd-annual-bodega-bay-fis
 hermans-festival?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://www.humanpresence.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Human Presence
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T183000
UID:260312Mptw-zAE9ESLhJNquBL67A
DESCRIPTION:A two day\, in person experience that brings presence back to 
 the center of how you live and lead. The design is simple. Few lectures. D
 irect experience. Carefully sequenced exercises that allow you to feel som
 ething first and understand it second.\n\nMost professional programs rely 
 on explanation. This one relies on experience. Participants move through a
  series of structured activities that engage the body\, attention\, relati
 onships\, and the subtle energetic signals that people constantly exchange
  but rarely notice. You encounter a shift before anyone attempts to explai
 n it. Language comes afterward.\n\nThe work draws from several disciplines
  that have studied human awareness and interaction. Somatic practices that
  examine the role of the body in perception and behavior. Attentional trai
 ning grounded in cognitive psychology. Relational dynamics that shape trus
 t\, influence\, and communication. And energetic awareness\, the often fel
 t but seldom named quality of presence people bring into a room.\n\nThe re
 sult is practical and immediate. Participants report clearer thinking\, st
 ronger connection with others\, and a deeper sense of grounded confidence.
  Presence stops being an abstract idea and becomes a direct experience you
  can generate intentionally.\n\nNo belief system is required. Nothing to a
 dopt. The work is experiential\, observable\, and repeatable.\n\nYou exper
 ience it first. Then the words begin to make sense.
LOCATION:The Lodge at Tiburon 
URL:http://www.humanpresence.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
