SUMMARY:BLOODY MARY CHALLENGE
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260502T130000
UID:260309hgnoLPRZYE-hvUaJbTbESA
DESCRIPTION:If you like your Saturdays spicy\, your cocktails bold\, and y
 our community strong - this event was made for you. Join Charbay Distiller
 y and the Santa Rosa Fire Department for a bloody delicious showdown: the 
 2nd Annual Bloody Mary Challenge\, where top local restaurants battle it o
 ut for the title of Best Bloody Mary in Sonoma County.\n\nYou’ll sip\, s
 ample\, and vote your way through a lineup of uniquely crafted Bloody Mary
 ’s\, each with its own twist—while supporting the firefighters who kee
 p our community safe.\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\nA Bloody Mary tasting adventur
 e from some of the most creative bars & restaurants in the region\n\nA peo
 ple’s choice vote - you decide who takes home the trophy\n\nA lively\, s
 ocial atmosphere in the heart of Santa Rosa\n\nDelicious brunch vibes from
  Grossman’s and the historic Hotel La Rose\n\nAll proceeds support the S
 anta Rosa Fire Fighters Foundation\, a local nonprofit that assists firefi
 ghters and their families in times of need
