 ing room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acros
 s the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll an
 d Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new soun
 ds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\nMimi & Gabe Mimi & Gabe aka “Le
  Duo” brings a fun\, eclectic mix of classic hits\, soulful ballads\, an
 d vibrant originals\, delivered with rich harmonies and a playful acoustic
  style. \n\nDetails\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event te
