DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260503T150000
UID:260407huPk1LFRykWuH2yY_-HWuQ
DESCRIPTION:An ancient prayer and meditation tool that relates to wholenes
 s\, the labyrinth combines the imagery of the circle and the spiral into a
  meandering but purposeful path\, representing a journey to our own center
  and back again out into the world.\n\n Join us as we walk in honor of Wo
 rld Labyrinth Day (note: this event takes place on Sunday\, May 3).\n\nThe
 re will be a brief talk and orientation at 12:30 p.m. followed by a facili
 tated walk. The labyrinth will be open till 3:00 p.m.\n\nAll are welcome.\
 n\nUnity of Santa Rosa is located in a business park across from and sligh
 tly north of Larkfield Center. There is ample parking.
LOCATION:Unity of Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.unityofsantarosa.org/events/uw02cjjfrfx1rpz1xy6h6rhxxvhdgj
