SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Icelandic Poppies Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nSaturday\, May 9th\n10:00AM - 1
 :00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$50\n\nBeautiful Icelandic Poppies!\n\
 nJoin us to unlock your inner florist and create a stunning crepe paper b
 ouquet of Icelandic Poppies.\n\nAll of us love to receive flowers but we 
 hate to see them go. Join me while I instruct you to construct realistic 
 crepe paper poppies. Make these lovely flowers for someone special or as 
 a treat for yourself. Each petal and leaf are hand cut from artisanal Ita
 lian crepe paper and then assembled by hand.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creat
 ive atmosphere as you learn to create your own masterpiece. This beginner
 -friendly class is designed to open up your imagination by learning basic
  techniques when using crepe paper as the flower composition. All necessa
 ry supplies and tools will be provided. Just bring your inspired-artful l
 ove of flowers. Participants will take home their finished bouquets.\n\nT
 o register: please email mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawford
