 ceded by pot luck snacks. Bring a game\, play what is there\, learn a new 
 game\, socialize\, eat! Members are welcoming and friendly\, ready to teac
 h new people how to play. Please\, no Crimes against Humanity.\nWe ask for
  a $2 donation to cover the cost.\nGame Night is every third Saturday unle
 ss otherwise noted. If cancelled\, you will receive email notice. Lately w
 e have a lot of no shows. Please take your reservation seriously and give 
 us advance notice if you cannot attend. It is a good idea to arrive at 6:0
 0.\nGame night is the third Saturday of every month.
