SUMMARY: ALLA PRIMA PAINTING: Create an oil portrait in one day!
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Maggie Parr\nSunday\, May 17th\n1:00pm- 4:00pm\nF
 ee: $75 includes ALL supplies (except your own easel)\n\n\n\nUsing three 
 practical and simple techniques—sight-size drawing\, the principle of lig
 hting\, and warm/cool colors—you’ll be able to paint a beautiful oil port
 rait in just one sitting. Maggie shares classical and contemporary method
 s in a fun and accessible way.\n\nAll paint\, brushes\, mediums\, palette
 s\, gloves\, rags\, and canvases are provided by the instructor. All you 
 need to bring is a table top or standing easel.\n\nTo register\, click he
 re [https://www.parrcreate.com/cart/253727-Alla-Prima-Oil-Portraits https
 ://www.parrcreate.com/cart/253727-Alla-Prima-Oil-Portraits ]\nor email ma
 ggie@maggieparr.com mailto:maggie@maggieparr.com .\n\nMaggie Parr is a fo
 rmer Disney Imagineer who has drawn\, painted\, and designed theme parks\
 , murals\, portraits\, illustrations\, products\, more. She has also purs
 ued mastery in oil painting for 32 years\, studying with some of the coun
 try’s best-known artists and teachers. She teaches in-person and online. 
 Visit www.maggieparr.com http://www.maggieparr.com/ for more information.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Oil-Paint,Painting
