SUMMARY:A Creative Photography Workshop
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260606T090000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260606T150000
UID:06a9801d32d6e198b21e384429e17204@jacklondonpark.com
DESCRIPTION:The camera you always carry with you—your iPhone camera! Mom
 ents\, memories\, and vistas –photographed with confidence and ease. For
  the first half we will discuss\, and demonstrate:The settings\, filters\,
  exposure\, focus\, shutter speeds\, panoramas\, macro\, close ups\, portr
 aits.  Throughout the workshop\, we emphasize the creative and artistic 
 side of photography. Then we will move outdoors to put into practical use 
 the things we have just talked about and have the chance for a quick lunch
  in the park
