SUMMARY: Drawing Roses with Colored Pencil
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin\n\nSaturday\, June 20th\n\n
 10:30AM - 3:30PM\nLocation: The Santa Rosa Store\n\nFee: $95.00\n\nPerhap
 s one of the most beloved and universally recognized flower is the rose. 
 Throughout history\, it has remained a favorite amongst gardeners and gif
 t givers. Join this workshop as we delve into drawing the beautiful rose 
 using colored pencil as a medium. The morning portion of this workshop wi
 ll focus on colored pencil principles and techniques\, student exercises 
 and creating color palettes. The afternoon will be dedicated to hands-on 
 drawing time with individual one-on-one assistance. All levels welcomed. 
 Ability to draw freehand is not needed to participate in this workshop. M
 aterials list to be emailed once registration is completed.\n\nTo registe
 r\, please contact Victoria at kochergi@sonic.net mailto:kochergi@sonic.n
 et mailto:kochergi@sonic.net or (707) 479-3336.\n\nVictoria A. Kochergin 
 is a local botanical artist and instructor who works with colored pencil 
 and acrylics. Her artwork has been exhibited in galleries\, wineries\, bo
 tanical gardens\, international shows and on Alcatraz. For more informati
 on about Victoria\, please visit her website at www.victoriakochergin.com
  http://www.victoriakochergin.com/
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Colored-Pencil
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/649f7289423de90e1d55ff36/scaled_768.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin Saturday\, June 20
 th 10:30AM - 3:30PM Location: The Santa Rosa Store Fee: $95.00 Perhaps on
 e of the most beloved and...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
CREATED:20260210T010639Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T135700Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260210T010639Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
