SUMMARY: Introduction to SoulCollage
DESCRIPTION:\nPresenter: Karen Haas\nSunday\, July 12th\n1:00PM-3:30PM\n$
 25.00 (Includes All Supplies)\nLocation: Santa Rosa\n\nSoulCollage® is pa
 rt creative exploration and part self-discovery. It’s fun and can be deli
 ghtfully surprising! Participants will explore the process of collage mak
 ing using magazines images on 5” x 8” canvas\, usually cut from mat board
  or other stiff paper. Collage allows everyone to be an artist\, even if 
 you don’t believe you have a creative bone in your body\, because you are
  working with found images. In this Introductory class you will also expl
 ore the intuitive process of "listening" to the wisdom of the collage you
  completed\, using images that you were drawn to. If one decides to keep 
 making these 5”x 8” cards\, you eventually have your own personally made 
 oracle deck that can offer you insights and guidance from deep soul wisdo
 m.\n\nYou’ll then learn how to “read” your card as it\nshares its deeper 
 meaning\, offering insights and guidance. www.artofpresence.net http://ww
 w.artofpresence.net/\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Ka
 ren at: 707-494-2205 by call or text\nor please email her at: karen@artof
 presence.net mailto:karen@artofpresence.net\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Collage
