SUMMARY: The Art of Acrylics
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Suzanne Carson\nWednesday\, Ongoing\n10:00AM-12:0
 0PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n$30.00 per class\n\nSuzanne will demo ea
 ch week as students follow along with weekly projects\, exploring techniq
 ues such as layering thick and thin paint\, using gels and palette knife\
 , and applying color theories. Students can work on their own projects as
  well.\n\nWhether you're a beginner or looking to refine your skills\, th
 is class covers everything you need to know. You'll get informed instruct
 ion on how to begin a piece\, from choosing the right materials to select
 ing the perfect color palette. We’ll dive into composition techniques to 
 help you craft a balanced\, captivating piece\, and walk you through the 
 finishing touches that bring your work to life.\n\nSuzanne's artwork rang
 es from portraits\, figurative genre\, landscapes and caricatures. She ha
 s exhibited in juried shows including The Society of Illustrators in New 
 York and for 10 years at the Southern California Laguna Beach Art Festiva
 l. She has taught classes and workshops for many years and led lecture-de
 mos at art associations from California to Washington State.\n\nFor enrol
 lment and supply list\, please text or call Suzanne Carson at 707 888 208
 3
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Acrylic,Acrylic-Painting
