 s discounts.\n\nDo you want to try watercolor for the first time? Or do y
 ou want to “brush up” on your watercolor techniques? This class will cust
 om-fit\nyour needs!\n\nKathryn can assist you if you prefer to work on yo
 ur own personal projects. Or participate in the many projects that I offe
 r and illustrate\, with “technique mini paintings” highlighting various w
 atercolor tools\, brushes\, paints\, color mixing\, paper\, and various t
 echniques used in\nwatercolor painting that can be applied to still-life 
 and landscapes.\n\nTo register for this class\, please contact Kathryn at
 : kathrynkeg@gmail.com mailto:kathrynkeg@gmail.com\nYou can also visit Ka
 thryn’s website at: http://Kathrynanne.biz.
